message: >-
  Cite the repository and identify the exact analysis run and source hash.
  Version 1.5 below identifies the historical release; current working-tree
  association analyses are not a newly published release.
title: MUC-QMJH Human Preference Analysis Repository
type: software
version: "1.5"
date-released: 2026-04-15
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Team
    given-names: MUC-QMJH
    affiliation: Minzu University of China
abstract: >-
  Research repository for observational associations between response length,
  formatting features and human pairwise preferences. Current analysis identity
  is recorded in CURRENT_RESULTS.json. Historical matching and SEM estimates
  are retained for audit and are not current inferential evidence.
keywords:
  - LLM preference
  - observational associations
  - reproducibility
